msgid "Ubuntu"
msgstr ""

#: ../pwntools/docs/source/install/binutils.rst:15
msgid ""
"For Ubuntu 12.04 through 15.10, you must first add the pwntools `Personal"
" Package Archive repository "
"<https://launchpad.net/~pwntools/+archive/ubuntu/binutils>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../pwntools/docs/source/install/binutils.rst:17
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Xenial (16.04) has official packages for most architectures, and "
"does not require this step."
msgstr ""

#: ../pwntools/docs/source/install/binutils.rst:25
msgid "Then, install the binutils for your architecture."
msgstr ""

#: ../pwntools/docs/source/install/binutils.rst:32
#: ../pwntools/docs/source/install/headers.rst:16
msgid "Mac OS X"
msgstr ""

#: ../pwntools/docs/source/install/binutils.rst:34
msgid ""
"Mac OS X is just as easy, but requires building binutils from source. "
"However, we've made ``homebrew`` recipes to make this just two commands. "
"After installing `brew <https://brew.sh>`__, grab the appropriate recipe "
"from our `binutils repo <https://github.com/Gallopsled/pwntools-"
"binutils/>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../pwntools/docs/source/install/binutils.rst:45
msgid ""
"Note: The pwntools/pwntools Homebrew tap is currently (August 2026) "
"undergoing migration. If you encounter issues on Mac OS, try running "
"``export HOMEBREW_DEVELOPER=\"true\"`` before ``brew install ...``. The "
"actual resolution of the tap migration is still pending."
msgstr ""

#: ../pwntools/docs/source/install/binutils.rst:51
msgid "Windows"
msgstr ""

#: ../pwntools/docs/source/install/binutils.rst:53
msgid ""
"Windows support is experimental. You can try installing a prebuilt "
"version of binutils for your desired architecture from the `GNU "
"Toolchains <https://gnutoolchains.com/>`__ project."
msgstr ""

#: ../pwntools/docs/source/install/binutils.rst:56
msgid ""
"Note: For x86 and x86_64, you should use the `ubuntu toolchain "
"<https://gnutoolchains.com/ubuntu/>`__ instead of the MinGW toolchains "
"due to differences in the commandline handling."
msgstr ""

#: ../pwntools/docs/source/install/binutils.rst:60
msgid "Alternate OSes"
msgstr ""

#: ../pwntools/docs/source/install/binutils.rst:62
msgid ""
"If you want to build everything by hand, or don't use any of the above "
"OSes, ``binutils`` is simple to build by hand."
msgstr ""

